      "title": "Step 1: the server sends a one-time challenge",
      "description": "### Step 1: the server sends a one-time challenge\n\nThe server returns the encrypted private key and a random **nonce** that expires in 2 minutes."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/lib/session.tsx",
