      "title": "Step 2: the browser unlocks the key and signs the challenge",
      "description": "### Step 2: the browser unlocks the key and signs the challenge\n\n**DSA topic:** 2. Digital signatures (Ed25519)\n\nOnly the right passphrase decrypts the key. The browser then **signs the nonce** with it."
    },
    {
      "file": "server/app.ts",
      "selection": {
