      },
      "title": "Step 3: the server checks the signature",
      "description": "### Step 3: the server checks the signature\n\n**DSA topic:** 2. Digital signatures (Ed25519), 3. Hash map / hash set\n\nThe nonce is deleted as it is used, so it cannot be replayed. The public key comes from the `ix.parties` **hash map**, and the signature must verify."
